  {
    "id": "cause_after_the_fire",
    "contentType": "cause",
    "title": "After the fire.",
    "titleLanguage": "en",
    "standfirst": {
      "source": "negotiated",
      "text": "Four estates lost vineyard to the January fires. What the relief fund is for, and who administers it.",
      "languageTag": "en"
    },
    "body": [
      {
        "source": "negotiated",
        "text": "The fires took roughly ninety hectares across four properties, most of it older plantings on the upper slopes.",
        "languageTag": "en"
      },
      {
        "source": "negotiated",
        "text": "The fund covers replanting and the three seasons before a young block carries fruit. It is administered by the regional association, not by us, and not by any estate in it.",
        "languageTag": "en"
      }
    ],
